# Internals are framework-only

`internals/` in this repo is **aq** (train folder, kernel, fleet, tracking, methods).

`axi` is a separate package. Its notes live in that package's own `internals/` (gitignored there). Do not add agent checklists or `agent-todo` files here. Do not link across.
